{
  "uid": "asap-cardinality",
  "title": "Cardinality: sketch vs exact vs Raw (real collector containers)",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-35m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Three ways to answer: how many distinct values does each attribute have each minute?",
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0 6px;border:none\"><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 10px 0 0;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle\"><b style=\"color:#5794f2\">Sketch</b><br><small>summarize each minute at the source</small></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>Sources A and B</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">generator-a/b</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>Summarize each minute: one HyperLogLog per attribute</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">branch-a/b</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>Combine A and B</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">merge</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>Distinct counts, and each attribute&#39;s class</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">detector</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>Store the answer</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">prometheus-sketch</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>Query: read the answer</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">query-job</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 0 0 12px;vertical-align:middle;max-width:360px\"><small style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">PromQL</small><br><code style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:normal\">asap_distinct{method=&quot;sketch&quot;, bound=&quot;estimate&quot;}[60s]</code></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 10px 0 0;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle\"><b style=\"color:#ff9830\">Exact</b><br><small>keep every value each minute</small></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>Sources A and B (same points)</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">exact-generator-a/b</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>Keep every value of every attribute each minute</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">exact-branch-a/b</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>Add up A and B</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">exact-merge</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>Distinct counts, and each attribute&#39;s class</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">exact-detector</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>Store the answer</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">prometheus-exact</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>Query: read the answer</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">query-job</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 0 0 12px;vertical-align:middle;max-width:360px\"><small style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">PromQL</small><br><code style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:normal\">asap_distinct{method=&quot;exact&quot;, bound=&quot;estimate&quot;}[60s]</code></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 10px 0 0;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle\"><b style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">Raw</b><br><small>store every point, compute when asked</small></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>Sources A and B (same points)</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">raw-generator-a/b</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>Forward each point as it arrives (OTLP forwarder, no window)</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">raw-sink-a/b</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>Store every point</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">prometheus-raw</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.12)\"><b>Query: count distinct values per attribute over the last 60 s</b><br><small><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">query-job</span></small></div></td><td style=\"border:none\"></td><td style=\"border:none\"></td><td style=\"border:none\"></td><td style=\"border:none\"></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 0 0 12px;vertical-align:middle;max-width:360px\"><small style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">PromQL</small><br><code style=\"font-size:11px;white-space:normal\">count(count by (user_id) (count_over_time(http_server_request_duration{user_id!=&quot;&quot;}[60s]))), one per attribute</code></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0\"><small>Same input for all three. Four attributes: <code>http.route</code> and <code>http.method</code> stable, <code>k8s.pod.name</code> growing 5%/min, <code>user.id</code> unique per point. Traffic grows over 30 minutes: the rate per source doubles every 5 minutes (5k to 80k points/s), and at minute 10 <code>http.route</code> explodes from 20 to 20,000 values. Every step is one container pinned to one CPU; each approach has its own Prometheus.</small></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0\"><small><b>Class</b> (per attribute and minute, from the last 10 minutes; every approach applies the same rules to its own counts): <b>identifier-like</b> when distinct / points is at least 0.9, i.e. nearly every point has a new value; else <b>growing</b> when distinct is more than 20% above the mean of the last 10 minutes (needs 3); else <b>stable</b>. Not classified below 100 points.</small></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0\"><small>Sketch and Exact read the stored distinct counts of the minute (evaluated at the minute&#39;s end, keeping the samples stamped with it). Raw computes each from every raw point of the minute (evaluated 1 ms before the minute&#39;s end).</small></p>"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Input: points per second (both sources)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "asap-prometheus-cardinality"
      },
      "description": "Points per second of the latest window, both sources together.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(sum by (method) (last_over_time(asap_points{method=~\"sketch|exact\",attribute_key=\"http.route\"}[2m]))) / 60",
          "legendFormat": "points/s",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Data shape: distinct values per key in the latest window",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "asap-prometheus-cardinality"
      },
      "description": "From the exact pipeline; the sketch's estimate for a key exact has not answered recently.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (attribute_key) (last_over_time(asap_distinct{method=\"exact\"}[2m])) or max by (attribute_key) (last_over_time(asap_distinct{method=\"sketch\",bound=\"estimate\"}[2m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{attribute_key}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Accuracy against exact",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Sketch (HLL): relative error of the distinct count per key, latest window compared",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "asap-prometheus-cardinality"
      },
      "description": "|estimate - exact| / exact; empty when the latest windows' points differ by more than 1% (a source missed a merge) or exact has no answer.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(abs(max by (attribute_key) (asap_distinct{method=\"sketch\",bound=\"estimate\"}) - on (attribute_key) max by (attribute_key) (asap_distinct{method=\"exact\"})) / on (attribute_key) max by (attribute_key) (asap_distinct{method=\"exact\"})) and on (attribute_key) (max by (attribute_key) (timestamp(asap_distinct{method=\"sketch\"})) == on (attribute_key) max by (attribute_key) (timestamp(asap_distinct{method=\"exact\"}))) and on () (abs(max(asap_points{method=\"sketch\",attribute_key=\"http.route\"}) - max(asap_points{method=\"exact\",attribute_key=\"http.route\"})) <= 0.01 * max(asap_points{method=\"sketch\",attribute_key=\"http.route\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "{{attribute_key}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0.1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.02
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "id": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "From data generated to query result (latest window)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "id": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Data generated -> query result: where the time goes",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "asap-prometheus-cardinality"
      },
      "description": "1. Window wait: sketch and exact compute per 1-minute window (the configured window), so a window's answer exists only after the window ends; Raw has no window. 2. Then until the data is queryable: sketch and exact until the detector wrote the window's answer to their Prometheus; Raw until prometheus-raw acknowledged the window's last point (otlp-forwarder forwards each point as it arrives). 3. The query that returns the answer on the approach's own Prometheus: sketch and exact read the stored answer (estimates only); Raw computes it from every raw sample (one PromQL distinct count per key, summed).",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(max by (method) (last_over_time(asap_window_wait_seconds[5m])), \"approach\", \"Sketch\", \"method\", \"sketch\"), \"approach\", \"Exact\", \"method\", \"exact\"), \"approach\", \"Raw\", \"method\", \"raw\")",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(max by (method) (last_over_time(asap_data_available_seconds[5m])) - on (method) max by (method) (last_over_time(asap_window_wait_seconds[5m])), \"approach\", \"Sketch\", \"method\", \"sketch\"), \"approach\", \"Exact\", \"method\", \"exact\"), \"approach\", \"Raw\", \"method\", \"raw\")",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(max by (method) (last_over_time(asap_query_seconds[5m])), \"approach\", \"Sketch\", \"method\", \"sketch\"), \"approach\", \"Exact\", \"method\", \"exact\"), \"approach\", \"Raw\", \"method\", \"raw\")",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "joinByField",
          "options": {
            "byField": "approach",
            "mode": "outer"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "includeByName": {
              "approach": true,
              "Value #A": true,
              "Value #B": true,
              "Value #C": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "approach": 0,
              "Value #A": 1,
              "Value #B": 2,
              "Value #C": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #A": "wait for the window to end",
              "Value #B": "then until data is queryable",
              "Value #C": "query"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "approach"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "stacking": "normal",
        "xField": "approach",
        "showValue": "always",
        "barWidth": 0.6,
        "groupWidth": 0.7,
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 85,
            "lineWidth": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "wait for the window to end"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#8e8e8e"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "then until data is queryable"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#ff9830"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "query"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#5794f2"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Resources per approach (generators and monitoring excluded)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
